Package: m6APrediction
Title: Prediction of m6A Sites using sequence features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Edain", "Perez", email = "e.perezmendoza26@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The functions in this package allow to predict m6A RNA modification 
    sites by using a trained random forest model and provided sequence features.
    Included tools are able to perform sequence data preparation and make predictions 
    for single samples or entire tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    randomForest,
    stats
